    "title"             "Knox Relay"
    "description"       "Server-side bridge mod for remote server management. Exports game state, inventory snapshots, player positions, progression, live character vitals and appearance, and processes item delivery and money deposit queues via file-based JSON communication. Provides /account register for linking a character to a website account, /report for filing a player report from inside the game, and a friends list with optional map pins: right-click a survivor to ask, accept from the Knox Desk or the website."
    "changenote"        "[h1]1.36 — Joining clients stay quiet[/h1]\n[b]Fixed[/b]\n[list]\n[*]A joining multiplayer client no longer runs the dedicated-server event loop, even when isServer() is missing at load, so the Mod Report no longer fills with Events.Add of null.\n[*]Every event hook is skipped if that event does not exist, including OnCreatePlayer and OnClientCommand.\n[*]Firearm ammo, chamber, and jam are only read when the equipped item is ranged, so holding an axe no longer throws every in-game minute.\n[/list]"
}
